{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01QYRVBNsrnyeuSZ57w93JFD","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0520/projects/ec_hte_llm_annotation/report.md\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"# Handover — 2026-05-23\\\\n\\\\n> 由 Agent 生成，每次状态变更后自动更新。硬限 150 行。\\\\n\\\\n## 运行中\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\\n## 待处理\\\\n- Paper Agent 正在整合 exp-038/039/040 结果到论文 appendix\\\\n- Rebuttal talking points 待更新（sign-reversal, F-L, κ, cross-LLM 数据）\\\\n- EMNLP 2026 ARR DDL: 2026-05-25（~40h）\\\\n\\\\n## 近期结论\\\\n\\\\n- **exp-038** (success): Policy reversal zone τ sweep — global correction 在 τ(0)<0.05 时导致 CATE sign reversal（τ=0.01→31%, τ=0.03→14.9%），EC-HTE 0% reversal。最危险组合 τ=0.01+δ_misclass=0.19→42.9%。\\\\n- **exp-039** (success, mixed): K=8 scalability — EC-HTE 在 K=2/4 显著优于 Global（bias 降 5-7×），K=8 退化（RMSE 0.34 vs Global 0.17），但 coverage 始终 ≥95.6%。根因：250/8≈31 expert/subgroup 不足。\\\\n- **exp-040** (success, mixed): Treatment-dependent misclassification — EC-HTE 在 γ_T≤0.05 时 robust（coverage ≥89.7%, RMSE 优势），γ_T≈0.10 为 breakeven point，γ_T≥0.15 严重退化。\\\\n- **exp-036** (success): Bootstrap SE 在所有 n_expert≥25 下维持 ≥95% coverage。\\\\n- **exp-037** (success): Temperature calibration 降低但不消除 Δπ，EC-HTE 仍然必要。\\\\n- **exp-035** (success): 非对称 CM（FPR≠FNR 7:1）下 coverage ≥93%。\\\\n\\\\n## Excitement 提分产出（R17 修复）\\\\n\\\\n| Artifact | 核心数字 | 状态 |\\\\n|----------|---------|------|\\\\n| sign_reversal_figure | 92% configs affected, 0% EC-HTE | ✅ 已注册 |\\\\n| cross_llm_heatmap | 9 LLMs, mean ρ=0.244, min=-0.80 | ✅ Reviewer PASS |\\\\n| bias_anatomy_heatmap | R²=0.9938, 52% grid debiasing hurts | ✅ Reviewer PASS |\\\\n| debiasing_hurts_summary | 26.5% of 2132 pairs hurt, real LLM 100% | ✅ 已注册 |\\\\n| policy_reversal_zone | τ=0.01→31% reversal, danger zone 可视化 | ✅ 已注册 |\\\\n| k_scalability_bars | K=2/4 优, K=8 boundary | ✅ 已注册 |\\\\n| treatment_dep_misclass_figure | γ_T breakeven ≈0.10 | ✅ 已注册 |\\\\n\\\\n## 趋势\\\\n成功 34 / 负向 5 / 失败 0 / 共 40\\\\n\\\\n## 下一步\\\\n- Paper Agent 整合新实验到论文\\\\n- Rebuttal talking points 更新\\\\n- DDL 前编译验证 + 提交\\\\n\\\\n## 资源状态\\\\nautodl-rtx6000: 空闲 cuda:0, cuda:1, cuda:2, cuda:3\\\\nlocal-cpu: 空闲\\\\n\\\\n## 告警\\\\n（无）\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 1755, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_017qp4rUWunC8kWKX2aGEtMU","session_id":"44ebc33a-5f0e-4594-9646-2fa2afa29759","uuid":"a4cb18e4-56e7-43ec-a598-776ab81d8b19","timestamp":"2026-05-23T20:28:46.094Z"}
